#Start
@showUI dialog
@showUI commandBar visible:true
@set route:"smoke-preview"
@back bg:game-a-academy-hall-fullscreen effect:fade time:0.05
@char alice pos:50
@rain power:0.5 wind:-1 hue:215 tint:0.55
@bgm bgm:game-a-main group:music volume:0.35
@sfx sfx:gentle-rain-loop group:rain loop:true volume:0.2
Narrator: CHECKPOINT SMOKE 00 - test-only VN entry is active.|#smoke_preview_00|
@choice "交互与存档" goto:#Interaction
@choice "Pixi 与媒体" goto:#Presentation

#Interaction
@set route:"smoke-interaction"
@rain power:0
@hideChars
Narrator: CHECKPOINT SMOKE CUE 00 - dialog before cue.
@cue "<b>CHECKPOINT SMOKE CUE 01</b> - centered borderless story text." author:Narrator speed:0.8 textId:game_a_cue_001
@hideUI dialog time:0.05 wait!
@cue "CHECKPOINT SMOKE CUE 02 - hideUI dialog does not affect cue." author:Narrator textId:game_a_cue_002
@hideCue time:0.4 wait!
@showUI dialog time:0.05 wait!
Narrator: CHECKPOINT SMOKE CUE 03 - dialog after cue fade.
@hideUI dialog time:0.05 wait!
@hideUI commandBar time:0.05 wait!
@showUI dialog time:0.05 wait!
@showUI commandBar visible:true time:0.05 wait!
Narrator: CHECKPOINT SMOKE UI - terminal visibility is stable and saveable.
@input playerName type:string summary:"输入测试代号" value:Felix
Narrator: CHECKPOINT SMOKE INPUT - input wait completed.
@wait i
Narrator: CHECKPOINT SMOKE PAUSE - explicit runtime wait completed.
Narrator: CHECKPOINT SMOKE SAVE LOAD SETTINGS - use shared command bar and pause sections now.
@choice "进入 Pixi 与媒体" goto:#Presentation

#Presentation
@set route:"smoke-presentation"
@back bg:game-a-academy-hall-fullscreen effect:fade time:0.05
@inback bg:game-a-snow-outskirts-frame effect:fade time:0.05
@char alice pos:50 time:0.05 wait!
@rain power:0.5 wind:-1 hue:215 tint:0.55 time:0.05
@flash color:#ffffff duration:50 wait!
Narrator: CHECKPOINT SMOKE PIXI - renderer task completed without phantom waits.
@choice "继续媒体测试" goto:#Media

#Media
Mira: CHECKPOINT SMOKE VOICE - textId audio is optional runtime intent. |#game_a_voice_0001|
@movie video:game-a-intro block:true
Narrator: CHECKPOINT SMOKE MOVIE - media wait completed and is not saveable playback state.
@rain power:0 time:0.05 wait!
@hideChars time:0.05 wait!
Narrator: CHECKPOINT SMOKE COMPLETE
@end
